nntp2sql (beta 0.50) - download Usenet (NNTP) article headers into a SQL database

Programs:
  nntp2sql               command-line downloader (SQLite, MySQL/MariaDB, PostgreSQL)
  isotope-viewer         GTK4 browser: articles, yEnc files, text articles, image viewer
  hydrogen-group-viewer  GTK4 browser for the groups table

Build:
  autoreconf -fi
  ./configure
  make
  sudo make install

Run:
  ./nntp2sql                 (no arguments: prints the complete option reference)
  ./nntp2sql --host news.example.com --ssl --user me --pass secret \
      --db-type sqlite --db-name news.db --init-db --group alt.test --limit 5000 --headers-only
  ./nntp2sql --host news.example.com --ssl --db-type mysql --db-name news0 \
      --group alt.test --since 10152026
  ./isotope-viewer
  ./hydrogen-group-viewer

Docs:
  README.md                      features, saved configuration, schema, known issues
  man nntp2sql
  man isotope-viewer
  man hydrogen-group-viewer
